 "description": "The Thales Luna K7 Cryptographic Module is a high-assurance, tamper-resistant Hardware Security Module which secures sensitive data and critical applications by storing, protecting and managing cryptographic keys. It provides end users with industry-leading security and performance, and can quickly be embedded directly into servers and security appliances for FIPS 140-2 validated key security. The module meets compliance and audit needs for FIPS 140, HIPAA, PCI-DSS, eIDAS, GDPR.",
